<title>CHINA: HK forecasts housing supply at 79,000 units/year.</title>
<headline>HK forecasts housing supply at 79,000 units/year.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong Financial Secretary Donald Tsang said on Wednesday the government expects housing supply at about 79,000 units per year over the next three years and about 104,000 units per year in the following five years.</p>
</text>
